            "value" : "此套件僅安裝了一部分。請重新安裝以修復，或將其解除安裝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package is still installed. Go back and choose Try Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
